message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Funis: equilibrium and form-finding of spatial compression paths"
version: 1.1.0
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24040974
repository-code: "https://github.com/colivieri89/Funis"
authors:
  - family-names: Olivieri
    given-names: Carlo
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3548-846X"
    affiliation: "Department of Engineering, Pegaso Telematic University, Naples, Italy"
abstract: >-
  Desktop application for the analytical Linear Arch Static Analysis (LASA)
  of continuous spatial compression paths under vertical and horizontal
  loads: supported paths with their lateral reactions and contact
  conditions, paths without reactions, form-finding of free curves and node
  equilibrium under concentrated forces. In the plane it gives the funicular
  line under vertical and horizontal loads and the thrust line assessment of
  arches of finite thickness.
keywords:
  - Linear Arch Static Analysis
  - spatial compression paths
  - form-finding
  - masonry
  - funicular
  - catenary
  - thrust line
  - masonry arches
